# F6 test: SET_KINEMATIC_POSITION E= does not force the extruder to be homed.
#
# SET_HOMED and CLEAR_HOMED take precedence over the explicit E value, so
# the extruder coordinate is set but the axis stays un-homed and the
# following E move must raise "Must home extruder axis first".
DICTIONARY atmega2560.dict
CONFIG extruder_coordinates.cfg
SHOULD_FAIL

M84
SET_KINEMATIC_POSITION X=0 Y=0 Z=0 E=10 SET_HOMED=xyz
GET_POSITION
G1 E20 F600
